Executable labeled subset DP and optimal row-operation reconstruction
Prepared in SHIN09-git's research project with substantial OpenAI Codex assistance.
Apache-2.0.

The labeled recurrence and the row-operation construction follow ALGORITHM.md
and PROOF.md at 03caa7f6cb5bd21c834024e9d81f6b43eb325b91, the mathematical
source of CrocSwap/integer-mult-bounds PR 6712. The original attribution is
retained in reference/ORIGINAL-NOTICE. It credits the debt-partition literature,
ToikY, Nick Petalas and the earlier determinant and row-operation results.

The HZ, Dummy and Binary Lean sources are reused byte-for-byte from
SHIN09-git/integer-mult-bounds at a924d462c9cc4803a54664e4d093d20edb0073b4.
This package adds the executable Lean DP, a proof of its optimal packing
invariant, instruction reconstruction and correctness for the guard endpoints.

